WEBVTT

00:10:58.654 --> 00:11:01.216
when he was afraid
he wouldn't survive a mission.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:03.286
VM: And we heard that story and, my gosh,

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:06.077
it just shifted how we saw him.

00:11:06.101 --> 00:11:08.582
Whole new dimension of this man,

00:11:08.606 --> 00:11:12.670
who we came to appreciate,
and we saw him as a whole person.

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.367
AG: It might seem simple,

00:11:14.391 --> 00:11:16.555
but the value of seeing
employees or coworkers

00:11:16.579 --> 00:11:18.586
as more than just their professional role

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:20.486
is lost on a lot of workplaces.

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:22.971
In Vivek's team, this exercise
seemed to help people

00:11:22.995 --> 00:11:25.246
bring some of their
personal lives to work.

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:27.362
VM: There was a greater
sense of connection,

00:11:27.386 --> 00:11:30.566
and all it really took was
five minutes once a week,